cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use restore-drill in your work, please cite it using this metadata."
title: restore-drill
abstract: >-
  Automated backup restore verification for self-hosted infrastructure.
  restore-drill restores real backup artifacts into disposable Docker containers
  or Kubernetes pods, validates the restored data, records RTO/RPO evidence, and
  publishes machine-readable results for audits and alerts.
type: software
